  "title": "Steamed Brisket in Guinness®",
  "description": "Beef brisket is rubbed with spices, doused with Irish stout beer, covered, and baked at a low temperature for 8 hours creating a steamed and tender brisket perfect for St. Patrick's day.",
  "authors": [
